cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Research Scan"
abstract: >-
  Verified evidence scans for a project brief: multi-query scholarly retrieval across OpenAlex,
  Semantic Scholar and arXiv, citation-graph expansion, rubric-based screening and reranking, and
  live DOI verification. The package contains no LLM SDK; the hosting agent supplies every
  judgement.
type: software
